<section id="features" class="mt-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl mb-0">
        What you unlock with PRO
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="slab-icon slab-icon--backward h-5 w-5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">On This Day &amp; Year in Review</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Go back to what you wrote on today’s date in past years, and revisit your biggest moments, people, photos and songs every winter.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15.75l5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5l1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l2.909 2.909M3.75 19.5h16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Photos &amp; links</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Add up to <%= CollageGenerator::MAX_IMAGES %> photos per entry (several become a collage), plus links that open right from your entry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.862 4.487l1.687-1.688a1.875 1.875 0 112.652 2.652L10.582 16.07a4.5 4.5 0 01-1.897 1.13L6 18l.8-2.685a4.5 4.5 0 011.13-1.897l8.932-8.931zm0 0L19.5 7.125M18 14v4.75A2.25 2.25 0 0115.75 21H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 18.75V8.25A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 6H10" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Edit anything, anytime</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Change your words, photos or an entry’s date in the iPhone app or the rich-text web editor, and write on the web for any day.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 6h9.75M10.5 6a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 10-3 0M3.75 6H7.5m3 12h9.75m-9.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-3.75 0H7.5m9-6h3.75m-3.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-9.75 0h9.75" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Custom email schedule</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Pick the exact days and times your “How was your day?” email arrives, or skip email and stick to the app and its widgets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Timeline, search &amp; #hashtags</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Scrub through years in one timeline, search every word you’ve written, and give a #hashtag a birthday or anniversary to see ages and milestones.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Yearly stats &amp; Spotify</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          See your writing rhythm by year and month, and play the Spotify songs you saved right inside your entries.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5m-13.5-9L12 3m0 0l4.5 4.5M12 3v13.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Easy imports</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Bring your existing journal over from Day One, OhLife, Ahhlife, or Trailmix.life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Ask Claude or ChatGPT</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Optionally <%= link_to "connect your AI assistant", mcp_server_docs_path, class: "text-accent hover:text-primary underline" %> to ask “What made me happiest this year?” or save entries by voice. Disconnect anytime.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 border-accent/30">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5M16.5 12L12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base text-primary font-sans">Full export anytime</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm">
          Download everything (or a single year) as a ZIP backup of your entries and photos to browse offline, or as Markdown for other apps and AI assistants.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
